ere referred to this job.","jpn_LearnMoreAboutReferrals_258":"Learn more about referrals","jpn_ItMayNotBeTheKindOfWorkTheyre_259":". It may not be the kind of work they’re looking for,","jpn_TheyMayHaveBeenBusyWithOtherW_260":". They may have been busy with other work,","jpn_TheyFeltItWasntTheRightFitFor_261":". They felt it wasn’t the right fit for their skills","jpn_ReferredBy_262":"Referred by","jpn_Avatar_263":"Avatar","jpn_ViewJob_264":"View Job","jpn_ReceivedReferral_265":"Received referral","jpn_WithdrawnProposal_266":"Withdrawn proposal","jpn_DeclinedInvite_267":"Declined invite","jpn_AcceptedInvite_268":"Accepted invite","jpn_ArchivedInvite_269":"Archived invite","jpn_HiredByClient_270":"Hired by client","jpn_MyProposals_271":"My proposals","jpn_YouAreCurrentlyWorkingOffline_272":"You are currently working offline","jpn_YouHaveNoFreelancersInThisTea_273":"You have no freelancers in this team.","jpn_SearchForJobs_274":"Search for jobs","jpn_ManageYourProfile_275":"Manage your profile","jpn_Active_276":"Active","jpn_Referrals_277":"Referrals","jpn_Offer_278":"Offers | Offers","jpn_With_279":"with","jpn_TheseAreOffersSentFromClients_280":"These are offers sent from clients.","jpn_ProposedContract_281":"Proposed contract","jpn_NbsptoInterview_282":"to interview","jpn_Clients_283":"Clients may contact you first about a job posting. If you don\'t want these inquiries, you can set your profile to private.","jpn_OrRecruiters_284":"or recruiters","jpn_ActiveProposal_285":{"fullText":"{activeProps} {with} {count} {proposal}","jpn_Proposals":"Active proposals | Active proposal | Active proposals"},"jpn_SubmittedProposal_286":{"fullText":"{proposals} {with} {count} {proposal}","jpn_ProposalsSubmitted":"Submitted proposals | Submitted proposal | Submitted proposals"},"jpn_MoreInfoOnOffers_287":"More info on offers","jpn_MoreInfoOnProposedContracts_288":"More info on proposed contracts","jpn_MoreInfoOnInvitationsToInterv_289":"More info on invitations to interview","jpn_MoreInfoOnActiveProposals_290":"More info on active proposals","jpn_MoreInfoOnSubmittedProposals_291":"More info on submitted proposals","jpn_ArchivedProposal_292":"Archived proposal ({n})| Archived proposals ({n})","jpn_ArchivedProposal_293":{"fullText":"{label} {count}","label":"Archived proposals | Archived proposal | Archived proposals"},"jpn_ArchivedInterview_293":{"fullText":"{archived} {with} {count} {proposal}","jpn_Archived":"Archived interviews | Archived interview | Archived interviews"},"jpn_YouHaventReferredAnyoneYet_294":"You haven’t referred anyone yet","jpn_FreelancersYouReferred_295":"Freelancers you referred","jpn_JobsReferredToYou_296":"Jobs referred to you","jpn_Warning_297":"Warning","jpn_FeeExplained_298":"Fee Explained,","jpn_ThisRangeIncludesRel_299":"This range includes relevant proposals, but does not include proposals that are withdrawn, declined, or archived. Please note that all proposals are accessible to clients on their applicants page.","jpn_Applicants_300":"{applicantsRange} proposals","jpn_JobPosted_301":"{postedJobs} job posted | {postedJobs} jobs posted","jpn_TotalChargesSpent_302":"{totalCharges} total spent","jpn_Interviews_303":" {totalInvited} interview | {totalInvited} interviews","jpn_HoursCountBilled_304":"{hoursCount} hour billed | {hoursCount} hours billed","jpn_OpenJobsCount_305":" open {openJobsCount} job | open {openJobsCount} jobs","jpn_TotalAssignments_306":"{totalAssignments} hire | {totalAssignments} hires","jpn_MemberSince_307":" Member since {clientRegistrationDate}","jpn_UpworkPlusClientsAre_308":"Upwork Plus clients are on a subscription plan that includes additional hiring features, such as search filters for top talent.","jpn_ThisClientDoesNotHav_309":"This client does not have a verified payment method with Upwork.","jpn_ACoverLetterIsYourFi_310":"A cover letter is your first chance to impress a potential client. Highlight your experience, personality, and interest to show them you’re the person for the job.","jpn_BeforeYouIntroduceYo_311":"Before you introduce yourself, start with what the client needs. They like to know that you’ve read the job description.","jpn_FeedBackCountReviews_312":"{n} review | {n} reviews","jpn_ExampleHelloThere_313":"{0} Hello there, I read your job posting and it looks like you need a web designer to help you build a website for your new business.","jpn_Example_314":"Example:","jpn_ThisIsTheMainPartOfY_315":"This is the main part of your proposal. Tell the client who you are, highlight your skills, and show how you can help them. Don’t forget to mention at least 3 of your professional skills.","jpn_HelpClientsExample_316":"I’m John and I help clients like you build an online presence to get more customers to their business and, ultimately, more sales. With 3 years of web development experience, I’m highly skilled in security, server maintenance, and new feature implementation and feel I can help you successfully complete your project. I’m organized, deadline-driven, and can work with you to map out a strategy and build a clean, responsive website that converts leads into customers. You can find similar projects and website builds on my profile.","jpn_ThisIsTheFinalParagr_317":"This is the final paragraph where you’ll sign off and include next steps. Try making your closer memorable and use a positive tone.","jpn_HowSoonAvailable_318":" How soon are you available for a call? It would be great to speak with you and learn more about how we can achieve your goal. Thank you for your time, and I look forward to hearing from you soon.","jpn_ACoverLetterIsYourFi_319":"A cover letter is your first chance to impress a potential client. Highlight your experience, personality, and interest to show them you’re the person for the job.","jpn_IntroduceYourselfAnd_320":"Introduce yourself and explain why you’re the person for the job. Feel free to suggest any changes to the job details or ask to schedule a video call.","jpn_CoverLetterExample_321":"Hello, I see you’re in need of a web designer who can help you create a website for your business. Who is the target customer for your website? If you already have a website, can you send me a link? Will you need branding material such as a logo? Do you have a budget in mind for this project?","jpn_CoverLetterExample_322":"I have 3 years of web development experience and I’m highly skilled in security, server maintenance, and new feature implementation. I’m organized, deadline-driven, and I’ve built websites for clients all over the country in a number of industries including finance, blockchain/cryptocurrency, fitness, and fashion.","jobn_BESTREGARDS_323":"Best regards,{action} John","jobn_FORMSTATUS_324":"Form status {0}","jpn_WeWillPolitelyNotify_325":"We will politely notify the client that you are not interested. The client will be able to view the reason you\'ve declined the invitation.","jpn_DeclineRefer_326":"Decline & Refer","jpn_ReferralsHelpFreelan_327":"Referrals help freelancers on Upwork succeed and help clients fill their job. Don’t worry, it’s quick and doesn’t affect your profile!","jpn_KeepTheOptionOpenFor_328":"Keep the option open for future work by messaging the client. You can also help them by referring a freelancer.","jpn_HereAreAFewRecommend_329":"Here are a few recommendations based on their work history and availability","jpn_ThisEmailMustBeAssoc_330":"This email must be associated with an Upwork freelancer account, otherwise they will not be notified","jpn_GreatWeLlSendTheRefe_331":"Great, we’ll send the referral to {name}","jpn_DeclineInvitationRef_332":"Decline Invitation {refer}","jpn_Hr_333":"{amount}/hr","jpn_Earned_334":"{amount} earned","jpn_JobPostRemovedThisJo_335":"Job Post Removed. This job was flagged as inappropriate and has been removed by Upwork","jpn_YouVeReachedTheMaxim_336":"You\'ve reached the maximum number of tries to upload your ID. {action} To verify your identity so that you can access all jobs, please {link}","jpn_YouDeclinedThisInvit_337":"You declined this invite and referred another freelancer:","jpn_ReasonForDeclining_338":"Reason for declining:","jpn_SendForBoostedpriceB_339":"Send for {n} Connect | Send for {n} Connects","jpn_InviteOnly_340":"Invite Only","jpn_WeeklyRetainer_341":"Weekly Retainer","jpn_FeaturedJo_342":"Featured Job","jpn_Week_343":"${amount}/week","jpn_LocalJo_344":"Local Job","jpn_Onsite_345":"Onsite","jpn_YesSendForRegularpri_346":"Yes, Send for {n} Connect | Yes, Send for {n} Connects","jpn_YouEnteredABidForBoo_347":"You entered a bid for {count} Connect, but the auction closed while you were editing your proposal. | You entered a bid for {count} Connects, but the auction closed while you were editing your proposal.","jpn_NoSendForRegularpri_348":"No, Send for {n} Connect | No, Send for {n} Connects","jpn_SubmitProposal_349":"Would you like to submit proposal for {n} Connect | Would you like to submit proposal for {n} Connects?","jpn_YouEnteredABidForBoo_350":"You entered a bid for {n} Connect, but didn\'t boost. If you click \'yes\' you will bid for a chance to appear at the top of the client\'s proposal list. | You entered a bid for {n} Connects, but didn\'t boost. If you click \'yes\' you will bid for a chance to appear at the top of the client\'s proposal list.","jpn_OnlyAcceptPaymentThr_351":"Only accept payment through Upwork, ensuring Payment Protection.","jpn_YouReSubmittingForAF_352":"You\'re submitting for a fixed-price project. While the majority of Upwork projects are completed successfully, please keep a few things in mind:","jpn_BeforeYouStartThePro_353_new":"Before you start the project, you and the client must agree to requirements, a budget and milestones. Upwork charges the client at the beginning of the project, and the money for each milestone will be held securely in project funds.","jpn_EscrowFundedPayments_354_new":"Project funds are released when the client approves work","jpn_WhenMilestonesAreCom_355_new":"When milestones are completed, the client can either approve work or request modifications to the work. Clients can also request that you approve the return of funds held.","jpn_IfYouDoTheWorkAndThe_356":"If you do the work and the client refuses to pay, Upwork can help mediate the dispute.","jpn_PleaseChooseFixedPri_357_new":"Please note: only funds deposited for an active milestone are covered by Dispute Assistance.","jpn_InOrderToSubmitAProp_359":"In order to submit a proposal, please contact your manager or administrator about upgrading to the Agency Plus membership plan.","jpn_LearnMoreAboutAgency_360":"Learn more about Agency Plus membership","jpn_WeVeAddedABoostOptio_361":"We’ve added a ‘boost’ option for jobs you really want. Bid your Connects for a chance to go to the top of the list.","jpn_YouMayStillSubmitAPr_362":"You may still submit a proposal, but the client will see that the proposal does not meet the following criteria:","jpn_ClientSBudgetCharged_363":"Client\'s budget: {chargedAmount}","jpn_ThisFeatureIsNotAvai_364":"This feature is not available because your client is suspended","jpn_BasedOnTheTypeOfJobs_365":"Based on the type of jobs you’ve applied to lately, packaging your work with Project Catalog™ could be an excellent option for you. Showcase your latest work, set your price, post it, and wait for quality clients to request your services.","jpn_DonTStopNowLetProjec_366":"Don’t stop now, let {categoryName} jobs find you!","jpn_FromProjectPricestar_367":"From {priceStart}","jpn_YourSkillsAndExperie_368":"Your skills and experience are in high-demand right now. With Talent Scout™ our recruiters will match you to exclusive opportunities with trusted clients—no fees attached.","jpn_ThisIsTheHourlyBudge_369":"This is the hourly budget the client specified when posting this job. You can consider it when setting your bid rate.","jpn_HowDoYouWantToBePaid_370":"How do you want to be paid?","jpn_Due_371":"Due","jpn_Amount_372":"Amount","jpn_TotalPriceOfProject_373":"Total price of project","jpn_ThisIncludesAllMiles_374":"This includes all milestones, and is the amount your client will see.","jpn_YouLlReceive_375":"You\'ll receive","jpn_HourlyRate_376":"Hourly rate","jpn_TheEstimatedAmountYo_377":"The estimated amount you\'ll receive after service fees","jpn_ApplyWithASpecialize_378":"Apply with a Specialized profile","jpn_ChooseOneOfYourSpeci_379":"Choose one of your specialized profiles to show the client your most relevant skills for this job.","jpn_ContractornameSGener_380":"{contractorName}\'s general profile will be submitted with this proposal. If you\'d like to submit proposals with customized skills, rates, and experience, ask {contractorName}\'s to create a specialized profile.","jpn_VerifyYourIdentity_381":"Verify Your Identity","jpn_ThisClientWillNotBeA_382":"This client will not be able to see your proposal for this job until you verify your identity. It’s a two-step process and it keeps you and our community safe.","jpn_BeforeYouCanWorkWith_383":"Before you can work with clients on Upwork you need to verify your identity.","jpn_WhatSThis_384":"What\'s this?","jpn_ThisEnterpriseClient_385":"This Enterprise client uses Upwork\'s compliance service, which requires freelancers and agencies to answer questions  about their business. This informs how this client can engage with you.","jpn_HowDoesThisHelpMe_386":"How does this help me?","jpn_ProvideDetailsAboutY_387":"Provide details about your business now so that you\'ll be ready to start work sooner if selected. Plus, it\'ll apply to other Enterprise projects as well.","jpn_HaveIDoneThisBefore_388":"Have I done this before?","jpn_YesYouProvidedDetail_389":"Yes, you provided details about your business last year. As part of Upwork\'s compliance program, you must update your business information once every year to be engaged by certain Enterprise clients.","jpn_IfYouBoostedThisProp_390":{"fullText":"If you tried to boost this proposal in a standard or {placeboAuction}, you won’t be able to submit it again after withdrawing.","placeboAuction":"Placebo Auction","anchorLink":"https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/11983621573395"},"jpn_IfYouBoostedThisProp_390_AI":{"fullText":"If you boosted this proposal in a standard or {placeboAuction} and you completed an instant interview, you won’t be able to submit it again after withdrawing.","placeboAuction":"Placebo Auction","anchorLink":"https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/11983621573395"},"jpn_WeWillPolitelyNotify_391":"We will politely notify the client that you are not interested. The client will be able to view the reason you\'ve withdrawn your proposal.","jpn_AddAnOptionalMessage_392":"Add an optional message to share with the client when we notify them that this proposal has been withdrawn.","jpn_AgencyAgencyinfoName_394":"Agency: {agencyName}","jpn_BusinessManagerAgenc_395":"Business Manager: {staffer}","jpn_PurchaseConnectsNowS_396":"Purchase Connects now so you can continue to submit proposals to great jobs without delay.","jpn_YouOnlyHaveBalanceBa_397":"You only have {n} Connect | You only have {n} Connects.","jpn_ThisClientHasSpecifi_398":"This client has specified that only {requiredLocation} location verified freelancers may apply. Only verified members of your agency are visible.","jpn_IfYouWantToSubmitAPr_399":"If you want to submit a proposal on behalf of one of your Agency\'s Members, you must first {action} upgrade your membership to Agency Plus.","jpn_BeforeYouReEligibleT_400":"Before you’re eligible to work with clients on Upwork you must verify your identity.","jpn_IfYouVeAlreadySubmit_401":"If you’ve already submitted a proposal the client will not be able to see it until you verify your identity.","jpn_ItSATwoStepProcessAn_402":"It’s a two-step process and it keeps you and our community safe.","jpn_BeforeYouCanWorkWith_403":"Before you can work with clients on Upwork you need to verify your identity. It’s a two-step process and it keeps you and our community safe.","jpn_BeforeYouReEligibleT_404":"Before you’re eligible to work with clients on Upwork you must verify your identity. It’s a two-step process and it keeps you and our community safe.","jpn_IfYouDeclineAnInvite_405":"If you decline an invite you’ll have the option to refer a fellow freelancer to the job. It’s quick and won’t affect your profile!","jpn_PageOfTotalpages_406":"{ page } of { totalPages }","jpn_WeLlNotifyTheClientT_407":"We’ll notify the client that you’re referring { referredFreelancerName } to this job. Thanks for passing it along!","jpn_IfYouDeclineAnInvite_408":"If you decline an invite you’ll have the option to help a fellow freelancer by referring them to the job. It’s quick and won’t affect your profile!","jpn_TheseAreContractsPen_409":"These are contracts pending acceptance from your clients","jpn_TheseAreProposalsYou_410":"These are proposals you sent which have not yet received a reply.","jpn_OrRecruiters_411":"or recruiters","jpn_ThisScreenDisplaysAl_411":"This screen displays all of your archived proposals. It includes the date communication began with the client and the reason the proposal was archived.","jpn_TheseAreInterviewInv_412":"These are interview invitations which have been archived.","jpn_WhenDecliningAnInvit_413":"When declining an invitation, you can make a referral to help other freelancers succeed and help clients fill their job","jpn_ReferredYouForAJob_414":"{name} referred you for a job invite that they declined{referralMessageCopy} but they still wanted to share the opportunity.","jpn_LetThemKnowWhyYouReR_415":"Let them know why you’re referring them to this job (and wish them luck!)","jpn_SearchUpworkForAFreelancers_416":"Search Upwork for a Freelancer","jpn_LetClientFreelancerKnow_417":"Let the client and freelancer know why you’re declining this invite","jpn_ExplainTheFreelancer_418":"Explain the freelancer\'s qualifications so the client can make an informed decision.","jpn_DescriptiveMessageFreelancer_420":"A descriptive message will help the freelancer understand why you referred them.","jpn_MoreLessAboutJobTitle_421":"More/Less about {this.jobTitle}","jpn_ThisClientPaidToPost_422":"This client paid to post their job. Pay only 10% (skip the 20% service fee) when you work on a Featured Job.","jpn_ThisClientPaidToPost_423":"This client paid to post their job and reach freelancers like you.","jpn_1Month_424":"< 1 month","jpn_13Months_425":"1-3 months","jpn_36Months_426":"3-6 months","jpn_YourBidIsSetTo_427":"Your bid is set to {0}","jpn_NumberOfConnects_428":"{n} Connect. | {n} Connects.","jpn_SelectACompany_429":"Select a company","jpn_Proposals_430":"proposals | proposal | proposals","jpn_ProposedContracts_431":"Proposed contracts | Proposed contract | Proposed contracts","jpn_InvitationsToInterview_432":{"fullText":"{invitations}{with}{count}{proposal}","jpn_Invitations":"Invitations to interview|Invitation to interview|Invitations to interview"},"jpn_OffersWithProposal_433":{"fullText":"{offer} {with} {count} {proposal}","jpn_Offers_999":"Offers | Offer | Offers"},"jpn_ProposedContracts_434":{"fullText":"{contracts} {with} {count} {proposal}","jpn_ProposedContract_281":"Proposed contract | Proposed contracts"},"jpn_Selected_435":"Selected","jpn_SinceYouWithdrewABoo_436":"Since you withdrew a boosted proposal for this job, you are no longer able to apply.","jpn_Hr_437":"hr","jpn_ValueIsRequiredAndCa_438":"Value is required and can\'t be empty.","jpn_DiscoverAllTheWaysYo_439":"Discover all the ways you can get started on Upwork by exploring our learning paths.","jpn_SubmittingAProposalI_440":"Submitting a proposal is one of many ways to find work. Upwork 101 guides you through setting yourself up for success.","jpn_ExploreUpwork101_441":"Explore Upwork 101","jpn_Templates_442":"Templates","jpn_Name_443":"Name","jpn_Notes_444":"Notes","jpn_Created_445":"Created","jpn_Edit_446":"Edit","jpn_Duplicate_447":"Duplicate","jpn_Delete_448":"Delete","jpn_Notes_449":"Notes","jpn_Hires_450":"Hires","jpn_Hired_451":"Hired","jpn_AddCoverLetter_452":"Add cover letter","jpn_EarnedInThousands_453":"{amount}k+ earned","jpn_EarnedInMillions_454":"{amount}m+ earned","jpn_InterviewUid_455":"Interview UID","jpn_ProposalUid_456":"Proposal UID","jpn_IAmWillingToPayHighe_459":"I am willing to pay higher rates for the most experienced freelancers","jpn_ContractornameDoesNo_460":"{contractorName} does not meet all the client\'s preferred qualifications","jpn_YouDoNotMeetAllTheCl_461":"You do not meet all the client\'s preferred qualifications","jpn_YouCantSubmitAPropos_462":"You can\'t submit a proposal if you don\'t meet the Location criteria.","jpn_BoostYourProposalIsU_463":"Boost your proposal is unavailable.","jpn_DoYouWantToBoostThis_464":"Do you want to boost this proposal?","jpn_MoreConnectsNeeded_465":"More Connects needed","jpn_profileNameSProfile_466":"{profileName}\'s Profile","jpn_AgencyMember_467":"Agency Member","jpn_contractorNameOrAge_468":"{contractorNameOrAgencyMemberString}\'s {occupationTitle} profile rate: {rate}/hr","jpn_YourOccuppationTitl_469":"Your {occupationTitle} profile rate: {rate}/hr","jpn_EditTemplate_470":"Edit Template","jpn_CreateTemplate_471":"Create Template","jpn_TemplateTips_472":"Template tips","jpn_TemplateSettings_473":"Template settings","jpn_Save_474":"Save","jpn_TemplateName_475":"Template name","jpn_Template_476":"Template","jpn_OpeningWithAProfessi_477":"Opening with a professional greeting, sharing highlights of your work experience while staying concise, and talking about your client’s goals are all elements to consider including in your template to help you write a successful cover letter.","jpn_EnterTemplate_478":"Enter Template","jpn_ASimpleNoteCanHelpYo_479":"A simple note can help you recall what’s inside your template and if it suited for jobs you’re interested in applying for.","jpn_EnterNotes_480":"Enter notes","jpn_IncludeCriticalDetai_481":"Include critical details","jpn_DontAssumeClientsHav_482":"Don’t assume clients have read your profile. Include work experience relevant to the job you’re applying for.","jpn_MakeItCustom_483":"Make it custom","jpn_AlwaysCustomizeYourC_484":"Always customize your cover letter. You can reuse general information but leave areas in your template to add custom information.","jpn_BuildClientConfidenc_485":"Build client confidence","jpn_AcknowledgeTheClient_486":"Acknowledge the client’s projects and explain how you’re uniquely qualified to solve their problems.","jpn_SettingExpectations_487":"Setting expectations","jpn_TalkAboutYourApproac_488":"Talk about your approach to the client’s project and working style.","jpn_IdentifyNextSteps_489":"Identify next steps","jpn_EndYourCoverLetterWi_490":"End your cover letter with:","jpn_DifferentTimesToMeet_491":"Different times to meet","jpn_WhenYoureAvailableOr_492":"When you’re available or online","jpn_QuestionsAboutThePro_493":"Questions about the project","jpn_DeleteTemplate_494":"Delete template?","jpn_YoureAboutToDeleteYo_495":"You’re about to delete your template «{templateTitle}». Are you sure you want to delete this template?","jpn_Ok_496":"Ok","jpn_GetAHeadStartOnThisP_497":"Get a head start on this project","jpn_ContinueQuestionnair_498":"Continue Questionnaire","jpn_StartQuestionnaire_499":"Start Questionnaire","jpn_SpecialProfilesPrese_500":"Special profile(s) preset","jpn_Received_501":"Received","jpn_TitleBoosted_502":"{title} Boosted","jpn_QuickApplyJobs_503":"Quick apply jobs","jpn_MoreInfoOnQuickApply_504":"More info on Quick apply jobs","jpn_YouCanSwitchThisOnOr_505":"You can switch this on or off anytime. When it\'s off, you can apply for jobs like before, but you won\'t see any quick apply jobs in search and recommendations.","jpn_ShowInSearchRecommen_506":"Show in search & recommendations","jpn_Sent_507":"Sent","jpn_QuickProposals_508":"Quick Proposals","jpn_MoreInfoOnDraftTeamP_509":"More info on draft team proposals","jpn_DraftTeamProposals_510":{"fullText":"{proposals} {with} {count} {proposal}","jpn_DraftTeamProposals":"Draft team proposals | Draft team proposal | Draft team proposals"},"jpn_ProposalsTemplates_511":"Proposals - Templates","jpn_ProposalsEditTemplat_512":"Proposals - Edit Template","jpn_SomethingWentWrongAn_513":"Something went wrong and accept failed. Please, try again later.","jpn_SomethingWentWrongAn_514":"Something went wrong and decline failed. Please, try again.","jpn_ServiceIsTemporaryUn_515":"Service is temporary unavailable. Please try again later.","jpn_Saved_516":"Saved","jpn_IHaveChangedTheTerms_517":"I have changed the terms in this proposal.","jpn_OverTotalChargesSpen_518":"Over {totalCharges} total spent","jpn_ValueIsRequiredAndCa_519":"Value is required and can\'t be empty.","jpn_ProposalsRange_520":"Proposals range","jpn_AmountPlusEarned_521":"{amount}+ earned","jpn_MoreInfoOnTeamDraftP_522":"More info on team draft proposals.","jpn_YourTeamDraftProposa_523":"Your team draft proposals are saved here.","jpn_TheseAreProposalsTha_524":"These are proposals that you are discussing with a client or recruiters.","jpn_TheseAreProposalsTha_525":"These are proposals that you are discussing with a client.","jpn_GroupLead_526":"Team lead","jpn_Collaborator_526":"Collaborator","jpn_GroupLeadSave_527":"Save","jpn_Completed_528":"Completed","jpn_InProgress_529":"In progress","jpn_Decline_529":"Decline","jpn_Submit_530":"Submit","jpn_AddCollaborator_531":"Add a collaborator","jpn_RemoveCollaborator_532":"Remove a collaborator","jpn_AddCollaboratorModalTitle_533":"Add a collaborator from your network","jpn_RemoveCollaboratorsModalTitle_534":"Which collaborator do you want to remove?","jpn_DeclineCollaboratorModalTitle_535":"Decline this team proposal?","jpn_DeclineCollaboratorModalBody_535":"We’ll remove you from the team proposal and details you’ve added will be lost. {0} about team proposals.","jpn_DeclineCollaboratorModalBody_535_1":"Learn more","jpn_Cancel_536":"Cancel","jpn_Decline_537":"Decline","jpn_CancelDraftModalTitle_538":"Discard team proposal?","jpn_CancelDraftModalBody_538":"Discarding this team proposal will delete the draft and any details added. You cannot undo this action.","jpn_Discard_539":"Discard","jpn_CollaboratorConfirmModalTitle_540":"Are you ready to submit?","jpn_CollaboratorConfirmModalBody_540":"Heads up! Once you submit your payment details, they cannot be changed. You can contact team lead if you need to make any changes.","jpn_PaymentModeChangeModalTitle_541":"Do you want to make this change?","jpn_PaymentModeChangeModalBody_541":"Please confirm that you want to change the way your team gets paid. All previous payment details for this team proposal will be changed.","jpn_Confirm_542":"Confirm","jpn_Remove_543":"Remove","jpn_RemoveCollaboratorModalTitle_544":"Remove {name} from this proposal?","jpn_RemoveCollaboratorModalBody_544":"Heads up! Once you remove {name} you can add them back later if you want, but payment details will be lost.","jpn_TeamMembers_545":"Team members","jpn_Description_546":"Description","jpn_Remove_547":"Remove","jpn_WithdrawModalTitle_548":"Withdraw team proposal?","jpn_WithdrawModalBody_549":"If you withdraw this proposal, your team will no longer be considered for this project.","jpn_WithdrawCollaboratorModalTitle_550":"Remove {name} as a collaborator?","jpn_WithdrawCollaboratorModalBody_551":"Once you remove {name}, you won’t be able to add them back, or update your cover letter or proposal attachment where they might be included.","jpn_ProposalsListInitiated_552":"Initiated","jpn_SubmitDraftModalTitle_553":"Confirm before you submit","jpn_SubmitDraftModalBody_554":"Make sure all collaborators are added and group terms are accurate. Once you send the proposal, you won’t be able to add anyone else.","jpn_LearnMoreAboutTeamProposals_555":"Learn more about team proposals","jpn_Hire_556":"Hire","jpn_YourProposalWasSentFor_557":{"fullText":"Your proposal was sent for {connects} and not boosted. To help continually measure how proposal boosting is helpful to users, this job has been randomly chosen by Upwork to not have any proposals be boosted to the top of the list. All proposals will still be shown to the client, but ranked organically. {link}","jpn_link":"https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/11983621573395-Boosted-proposal-placebo-auctions","jpn_connects":"{n} Connect | {n} Connects"},"jpn_FailedToLoadProposalsDraft_558":"Failed to load proposal draft.","jpn_NotBoostedLearnMore_559":{"fullText":"Not boosted {learnMore}","jpn_link":"https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/11983621573395-Boosted-proposal-placebo-auctions"},"jpn_JPSubmitError_9012":"This proposal cannot be submitted because {name} has a pending or active proposal for this job post. {name} must either withdraw their proposal or be removed from your proposal to continue.","jpn_JPSubmitError_9012_current":"This proposal cannot be submitted because you already have a pending or active proposal for this job post. You must withdraw your existing proposal in order to continue.","jpn_FreelancerAvatarAlt_9013":"{freelancerName} avatar","jpn_ProfileDetails_AvatarAlt_9014":"{name} Avatar","jpn_FailedToLoadProposalsDraft_557":"Failed to load proposal draft.","jpn_StaySafeAndBuildYourReputation":"Stay safe & build your reputation","jpn_3Things":"3 things you need to know","jpn_ActionRequired":"Action required:","jpn_PhoneVerificationRequired":"Verify your phone number in order to start submitting proposals.","jpn_GetStarted":"Get started.","jpn_HowItWorks":"How it works","jpn_SelectYourReasonForDeclining":"Select your reason for declining (Your reason won’t be shared with the client)","jpn_DeclineInterviewMessage":"Thank you for your invitation. Unfortunately, I’m not able to take on new projects right now. ","jpn_WellLetTheClientKnow":"We’ll let the client know that you declined their job.","jpn_ViewedByClient_600":"Viewed by client","jpn_New_601":"New","jpn_VerifyYourId":"Verify your identity","jpn_VerificationModal1":"To keep Upwork the most trusted freelance marketplace, please verify your identity.","jpn_VerificationModal2":"You’ll only need to do this once, and verification happens in real time.","jpn_ProposalViews_602":"Proposal Views","jpn_StartingFromDate_603":"You will now see when clients view your proposals.","jpn_AGreatCoverLetterIs_604":{"fullText":"A great cover letter is important for earning a job. Need some help crafting an effective letter? Start by {anchor} on cover letter writing","jpn_takingALesson":"taking a lesson"},"jpn_WellWrittenCoverLettersAre_605":"Well written cover letters are important to earning jobs. Don’t know how to craft an effective letter? Start by {anchor} on cover letter writing.","jpn_CommunityArticle_606":"Community Article","jpn_CommunityArticleNotFound_607":"Community Article not found","jpn_AdditionalDetails_608":"Additional details","jpn_SetUp1on1VirtualConsultation_609":"Set up a 1-on-1 virtual consultation","jpn_LeverageYourKnowledgeToIncrease_610":"Leverage your knowledge to increase earnings and build your network. Just set your hours and rate, then let clients come to you.","jpn_NoThanks_611":"No Thanks","jpn_CreateAConsultation_612":"Create a consultation","jpn_ProposalsCreateTemplate_613":"Proposals - Create Template","jpn_Terms_614":"Terms","jpn_EstimatedDuration_615":"Estimated duration","jpn_LoadingCommunityArticle_616":"Loading Community Article","jpn_ProposalCoverLetterTips_617":"Proposal cover letter tips","jpn_AGreatCoverLetterIs_618":{"fullText":"A great cover letter is important for winning work. If you need help, {anchor}","jpn_CheckOutThisQuickVideo":"check out this quick video"},"jpn_SeeCompetitorBidsWithFreelancer_619":{"fullText":"Upgrade to Freelancer Plus. Get Connects, tools and view other freelancer bids. Subscribers on average have a 50% higher chance of being hired. {anchor}","jpn_UpgradePlan":"Upgrade plan"},"jpn_DraftChangesSaved":"Your changes have been saved.","jpn_Notes_621":"Notes","jpn_YourProposalWa